This folder contain the Sender Side source code, in which the USB-A peripheral are connected.
This includes the source files and associated header files:
    - hid_host.c/h - implementing HID USB host functionality through TinyUSB library 
    - laser_tx_sender.c/h - used for controlling sending through UART over laser link
    - laser_rx_sender.c/h - used for controlling receiving through UART over laser link
    - packet_queue.c/h - used to implement queue data structures
    - msc_host.c/h - used to implement MSC functionality (not complete)
This folder also relies on both TinyUSB and STM32 HAL libraries, both of which are acknowledged and open source.
The created source files are covered under the MIT open source license. 